# TrialBox runs on Linux (bash scripts, Makefile, Dockerfiles): keep LF line endings on every OS, also on Windows
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.ttf binary
*.jar binary
*.sqlite binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.csv -text
*.tsv -text
*.eml -text
